184
00:11:04,820 --> 00:11:07,320
But the new ads depicting a bride and groom dressed

185
00:11:07,420 --> 00:11:10,320
in cellophane, revealing their unmentionables,

186
00:11:10,420 --> 00:11:14,240
had Hitler and his master race shaking their heads.

187
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:17,500
And so when they saw this picture of the cellophane

188
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:23,080
wedding, here was a clear way to once again demonstrate

189
00:11:23,180 --> 00:11:25,780
the inferiority of the Western democracies.

190
00:11:25,781 --> 00:11:27,320
Now everybody in the United States

191
00:11:27,420 --> 00:11:28,580
gets married in their underwear,

192
00:11:28,680 --> 00:11:30,280
and nothing is sacred anymore.

193
00:11:30,380 --> 00:11:32,420
Not even marriage is sacred anymore.

194
00:11:32,520 --> 00:11:35,360
And so in many ways, Jockey was at war with Hitler

195
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:37,760
before the rest of the world.

196
00:11:37,860 --> 00:11:39,320
Jockey won its war, of course,

197
00:11:39,420 --> 00:11:41,960
